---
title: "Weekly digest for a member who unsubscribes during a send run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: bad
    lg1: off
    lg2: on
    lg3: Breaks NoSendReservedAfterUnsubscribe
    lg4: Path to the NoSendReservedAfterUnsubscribe bug
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 tan
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Member subscribed, no digest yet
  s1: Member subscribed, no digest yet, picked for this run
  s2: Member unsubscribed, no digest yet, picked for this run
  s3: Member unsubscribed, no digest yet, digest about to go out
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the run checks the member is still subscribed
  s1 --> s2: the member clicks Unsubscribe
  s2 --> s3: the run reserves this week's send
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 tan
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 pink
  class s3 breaks
  class s3 bugPath
